cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  The demo notebooks have no DOI of their own. If you use canVODpy, please
  cite canVODpy as below.
type: software
title: "canVODpy Demo: Interactive marimo Notebooks for the canVODpy GNSS-Transmissometry Ecosystem"
abstract: >
  Interactive marimo notebooks covering the canVODpy pipeline from raw GNSS
  data ingestion through VOD retrieval and visualization. Runnable locally or
  in the browser via marimo molab.
authors:
  - family-names: Bader
    given-names: Nicolas François
    email: support@canvodpy.eu
    affiliation: "TU Wien, Department of Geodesy and Geoinformation, Climate and Environmental Remote Sensing CLIMERS Research Unit"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9932-1925"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TUW-GEO/canvodpy-demo"
url: "https://canvodpy.eu"
keywords:
  - GNSS-Transmissometry
  - GNSS-T
  - vegetation optical depth
  - VOD
  - canVODpy
  - marimo
  - notebooks
license: Apache-2.0
preferred-citation:
